      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 685837855,
      "version": 67,
      "versionNonce": 742709855,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786315816970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) How we ensure system is fault tolerant and durable?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) How we ensure system is fault tolerant and durable?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xfpwpt7XVgzVxlaSMr7iY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 889,
      "y": 1398.5,
      "width": 695.5194702148438,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1013834431,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 724032529,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786316093694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Write bid to message queue, so even if bid services crashes,\nbid is safely store and won't be lost. --> Buffering against load spikes.\n2) Kafka guarantee message ordering within single partition.\nBy partitioning by auctionId, all bids for same auction\nland on same partition and processed in order they were received.\nThis help to guarantee fairness. \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Write bid to message queue, so even if bid services crashes,\nbid is safely store and won't be lost. --> Buffering against load spikes.\n2) Kafka guarantee message ordering within single partition.\nBy partitioning by auctionId, all bids for same auction\nland on same partition and processed in order they were received.\nThis help to guarantee fairness. \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yUwOvAztS1VlYEnvowAoo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1721,
      "y": 1370.5,
      "width": 820.3193969726562,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 158542257,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 1458775473,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786316146577,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1/ User submits a bid through our API\n2/ API Gateway routes to a producer which immediately writes the bid to Kafka\n3/ Kafka acknowledges the write, and we can tell the user their bid was received\n4/ The Bid Service consumes the message from Kafka at its own pace\n5/ If the bid is valid, it's written to the database\n6/ If the Bid Service fails at any point, the bid remains in Kafka and can be retried",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1/ User submits a bid through our API\n2/ API Gateway routes to a producer which immediately writes the bid to Kafka\n3/ Kafka acknowledges the write, and we can tell the user their bid was received\n4/ The Bid Service consumes the message from Kafka at its own pace\n5/ If the bid is valid, it's written to the database\n6/ If the Bid Service fails at any point, the bid remains in Kafka and can be retried",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vpTNo8qNUm4_obkPMTb6L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1717.01953125,
      "y": 1305.6015625,
      "width": 919.2393188476562,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1309890385,
      "version": 346,
      "versionNonce": 776343967,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786316223849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kafka guarantee high throughput, durability (persist to disk, can be configured for replication,\nensure we never lose a bid. Also support partition -- in this case, partition by auctionID",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kafka guarantee high throughput, durability (persist to disk, can be configured for replication,\nensure we never lose a bid. Also support partition -- in this case, partition by auctionID",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
